---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
import Section from "@components/Section.astro";

import sellapp_icon from "@assets/sellapp.webp";
---

<Page path={Astro.url.pathname} title="Purchase Info">
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://sell.app" />
	</Fragment>

	<h1>🔥 NullFire+ 🔥</h1>
	<p class="lead-subtext">
		NullFire+ is a premium script for Roblox that offers many features and advantages.<br />
		You can currently buy NullFire+ from one platforms.
	</p>

	<Section title="Features" id="features">
		<p>NullFire+ is an addon to the normal NullFire which provides these perks:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>keysystem bypass (when the keysys is enabled)</li>
			<li>extra features (depends on game)</li>
			<li>access to #hidden-general in our Discord</li>
			<li>more to come soon!</li>
		</ul>
	</Section>

	<Section title="Purchase Methods" id="purchase">
		<div class="buttonsList">
			<a class="purchaseButton" href="https://nullfire.sell.app/product/nullfire" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
				<Image
					src={sellapp_icon}
					format="webp"
					quality="max"
					priority
					class="icon"
					draggable="false"
					aria-hidden="true"
					alt=""
					referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
					crossorigin="anonymous"
				/> Pay with SellApp
			</a>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<p>By purchasing NullFire+, you agree to the <a href="/tos" rel="terms-of-service noreferrer">Terms of Service</a></p>

	<br />
	<p>Copyright (c) 2024-2026 maxxus and contributors | <a href="/privacy" rel="privacy-policy noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="/tos" rel="terms-of-service noreferrer">Terms of Service</a></p>
</Page>

<style>
	.buttonsList {
		justify-content: center;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1.5rem; /* ~24px */
	}

	.purchaseButton {
		background-color: #8c00ff;
		color: #fff;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 7px;
		padding: 0.5lh 0.75lh;
		font-size: 0.8em; /* ~16px */
		font-weight: 700;
		font-family: "Quicksand", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
		font-feature-settings: normal; /* cuz this is set for *all* text instead of just for the jetbrains font. i should probably fix that. */
		text-decoration: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		display: inline-block;
		text-align: center;
		vertical-align: middle;
		-webkit-user-select: none;
		user-select: none;
	}
	.purchaseButton:hover {
		background-color: #8000db;
	}

	.icon {
		width: auto;
		height: 1lh;
		object-fit: contain;
		aspect-ratio: 1/1 auto;
		vertical-align: middle;
	}

	.tocList {
		font-size: 0.9em; /* ~18px */
		margin-top: 0.3lh;
	}
	.tocList > li:not(:first-child) {
		margin-top: 0.25lh;
	}
</style>
